claim.claim-text:
the magnetic field generating device connected to the energy storage device;
wherein the magnetic field generating device is configured to provide magnetic treatment comprising a time-varying magnetic field having a magnetic flux density in a range of 0.5 Tesla to 7 Tesla and a repetition rate of the magnetic impulses in the range of 0.1 Hz to 700 Hz in order to cause muscle contraction to the patient;
characterized in that,
the device further comprises:
a radiofrequency electrode configured to provide a radiofrequency treatment in form of a radiofrequency field in order to cause heating of the patient;
wherein the radiofrequency electrode is positioned between the magnetic field generating device and the patient.
